json5p/list
description: Comma-separated list of values, enclosed into square brackets; a trailing comma is allowed
- >
  A json5p list is a
  [json5/list](::language:01-Concretes_2:03-json5_code:00-json5_structured:01-json5_list) whose
  elements are json5p values — in particular, a pointer can stand as an element. An element can
  be ANY json5p value — the grammar recurses here:
- !!<format: text/x-json5p> |
  [1, 'two', *": pets: 0",]
- *..:..
